#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:38
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Built on the Chromium Embedded Framework. Karere 4.0 replaces the WebKitGTK "
"backend with the Chromium Embedded Framework, bringing full video attachment "
"playback (H.264/AAC), multi-account support with isolated sessions, per-"
"account zoom, and a faster, more compatible rendering engine while keeping "
"the same native GTK4/libadwaita shell."
msgstr ""
"Sasa imejengwa juu ya CEF/Chromium 148. Karere 4.0 inachukua nafasi ya "
"backend ya WebKitGTK na Chromium Embedded Framework, ikileta uchezaji kamili "
"wa viambatisho vya video (H.264/AAC), usaidizi wa akaunti nyingi zenye "
"vipindi vilivyotengwa, ukuzaji kwa kila akaunti, na injini ya uonyeshaji "
"yenye kasi na uoanifu zaidi huku ikidumisha ganda lile lile asili la GTK4/"
"libadwaita."

